{"id":"st2094-2","designation":"ST 2094-2","title":"Dynamic Metadata for Color Volume Transform — KLV Encoding and MXF Mapping","state":"active","suite":"2094","official":{"family_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/doc/st2094-2/","latest_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/latest/st2094-2/","checked_at":"2026-11-11"},"scope":"The SMPTE ST 2094 suite of documents defines metadata for use in color volume transforms of content. SMPTE ST 2094-2 specifies Key-Length-Value (KLV) representations of metadata sets defined in SMPTE ST 2094-10, SMPTE ST 2094-20, SMPTE ST 2094-30, SMPTE ST 2094-40, and SMPTE ST 2094-60. SMPTE ST 2094-2 specifies frame-based mapping of KLV-encoded SMPTE ST 2094 metadata sets into the MXF Generic Container. SMPTE ST 2094-2 specifies the key and value fields of the essence elements, the essence container label and the essence descriptor.","outline":[],"definitions":[{"term":"ApplicationIdentifier","definition":"urn:smpte:ul:060e2b34.0101010e.05310101.00000000"},{"term":"ApplicationVersionNumber","definition":"urn:smpte:ul:060e2b34.0101010e.05310102.00000000"},{"term":"BackwardsVersion","definition":"urn:smpte:ul:060e2b34.0101010e.05310103.00000000"},{"term":"TimeIntervalStart","definition":"urn:smpte:ul:060e2b34.0101010e.05310104.00000000"},{"term":"TimeIntervalDuration","definition":"urn:smpte:ul:060e2b34.0101010e.05310105.00000000"},{"term":"UpperLeftCorner","definition":"urn:smpte:ul:060e2b34.0101010e.05310106.00000000"},{"term":"LowerRightCorner","definition":"urn:smpte:ul:060e2b34.0101010e.05310107.00000000"},{"term":"WindowNumber","definition":"urn:smpte:ul:060e2b34.0101010e.05310108.00000000"},{"term":"TargetedSystemDisplayPrimaries","definition":"urn:smpte:ul:060e2b34.0101010e.05310109.00000000"},{"term":"MinimumPqencodedMaxrgbOffset","definition":"urn:smpte:ul:060e2b34.0101010e.05310110.00000000"},{"term":"AveragePqencodedMaxrgbOffset","definition":"urn:smpte:ul:060e2b34.0101010e.05310111.00000000"},{"term":"MaximumPqencodedMaxrgbOffset","definition":"u